.TH HD-LINK-REPO 8 "October 2026" "hd-base" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-link-repo \- switch the HyprDebian repository of apt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hd-link-repo
.RI [ url ]
.RB [ \-\-suite
.IR suite ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hd-link-repo
links the system to a HyprDebian repository, the one apt gets the hd-*
packages from, and to a suite of it.
Without arguments it shows the current repository and suite, from
.IR /etc/apt/sources.list.d/hyprdebian.local.sources .
.PP
With a
.I url
it switches to the repository there, and with
.B \-\-suite
to another suite; what is left out stays as it is.
A switch:
.IP 1. 4
downloads the signing key from
.IB url /hyprdebian\-archive\-keyring.pgp
to
.IR /usr/share/keyrings/hyprdebian\-archive\-keyring.pgp ,
and stops when that fails;
.IP 2. 4
writes the apt source from the template
.IR /usr/share/hd-base/templates/hyprdebian.local.sources.j2 ;
.IP 3. 4
updates the package lists of that source alone, and puts the old source and
key back when that fails;
.IP 4. 4
updates all package lists, and writes the login banner again with
.BR hd-issue (8),
which shows the suite.
.PP
It does not upgrade the packages; run
.BR hd-up (1)
for that.
Run it as root to switch.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I url
The URL of the repository, starting with
.B http://
or
.BR https:// .
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-suite " " \fIsuite\fR
The suite of the hd-* packages:
.B trixie
or
.BR unstable .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when the repository and suite were shown or switched, 1 when the switch
failed, with the old source in place, and 2 for wrong arguments.
.SH EXAMPLES
Show the current repository and suite:
.PP
.RS
.nf
hd-link-repo
.fi
.RE
.PP
Switch to another repository, and to unstable:
.PP
.RS
.nf
sudo hd-link-repo http://repo.example/ \-\-suite unstable
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list.d/hyprdebian.local.sources
The apt source of the HyprDebian repository.
.TP
.I /usr/share/keyrings/hyprdebian\-archive\-keyring.pgp
The signing key of the repository, which the source names in
.BR Signed\-By .
.TP
.I /usr/share/hd-base/templates/hyprdebian.local.sources.j2
The template of the apt source.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-base (7),
.BR hd-issue (8),
.BR hd-up (1),
.BR hd-repo (7),
.BR sources.list (5)
